subckt Main (VDD VSS VB2 VB1 Vin Vout)
C1 (Vin net0) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net1 Vin) capacitor c=1p
M1 (VSS net0 Vout Vout) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (VDD net1 Vout Vout) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
R2 (net1 VB2) resistor r=1k
R3 (net0 VB1) resistor r=1k
